  {
    "uuid": "07ef8451-1fd6-5ea5-a1f9-a1c6f6901b41",
    "entry": "鶯遷",
    "reading": {
      "primary": "おうせん",
      "alternatives": [],
      "is_heteronym": false
    },
    "grammar": {
      "pos": [
        "名詞"
      ],
      "ctype": null,
      "inflections": null
    },
    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "warbler flying from a valley to a tree",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "古典の授業で、谷から木へと飛び移る鶯の姿を詠んだ鶯遷の詩句を学んだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "詩人はその情景を鶯遷の語で表し、境遇の変化への願いを重ねた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "鶯遷とは、鶯が暗い谷から明るい高木へと移ることを言う。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "finding success in life",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "苦労を重ねた末に念願の合格を果たした彼の歩みは、まさに鶯遷といえる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "下積み生活を経て一流の舞台に立った女優の半生は鶯遷の物語だと評された。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "貧しい家庭から身を起こした創業者の生涯を鶯遷と称える記事が掲載された。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "passing the palace examination",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "科挙に最終合格した者の栄誉を、鶯遷と呼んで祝った。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "鶯遷を果たした若者は、故郷の村に錦を飾って帰ってきた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "何度も試験に挑み続けた末、ついに鶯遷を遂げた彼の姿に人々は拍手を送った。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
    ],
